From 8a92d2006010386622b410df0efa198e058f7bb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peripheral Pretender setup <pp-setup@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:33:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 43/43] hw/adc: PIC32CM MC00 sigma-delta ADC (SDADC U2260)

Three differential pairs against INTREF, AREFB, the DAC or INTVCC;
24-bit result with offset, gain and shift correction as checked on
MC00 silicon (OFFSETCORR added, saturation at 0x7FFFFF), window and
free-running mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
